  Delta V^Pauli LDA-XC:                 -0.236358335895076         -6.4316          -148.32          -620.56
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Exchange:            0.029614418261800          0.8058            18.58            77.75
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Correlation:        -0.020801903782034         -0.5660           -13.05           -54.62
                                      --------------------     -----------       ----------      -----------
  Total Pauli Repulsion:                 0.434139976615235         11.8135           272.43          1139.83
 (Total Pauli Repulsion =
  Delta E^Pauli in BB paper)

